      <tei:div facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n240.jpg">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/qedushah/mimeqomo"/>From His dwelling place may He turn in mercy and show compassion to the people that <tei:choice><j:option corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/qedushah/mimeqomo/proclaim_day_without_comma" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n240.jpg">proclaim the unity of His Name. Evening and morning twice each day</j:option><j:option corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:amidah/qedushah/mimeqomo/proclaims_day_with_comma" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n242.jpg">proclaims the unity of His Name. Evening and morning twice each day,</j:option></tei:choice> do they constantly utter the Shema in love. <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
